[15.877883, "o", "\u001b[34mi Reading the workload and asking the agent; this can take a few minutes…\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi Checkout 5xx above 5%: errors began right after the latest rollout of shop/checkout.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   1. The latest release introduced a regression (High)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   2. Pods are short of memory under load (Medium)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   3. A downstream dependency is slow (Low)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi Waiting for approval: rollback: Proposed — run shep incident approve 44c1706c-5dbf-40d0-9cc0-92247fed7b83\u001b[39m\r\n"]
