[19.22323, "o", "\u001b[34mi \u001b[35mCheckout 5xx above 5%\u001b[34m \u001b[90mCritical · Open\u001b[34m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:37.928Z\u001b[34m Opened: An alert opened a Critical incident: Checkout 5xx above 5%\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:40.542Z\u001b[34m Note: Alert again: Checkout 5xx above 5%\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:47.447Z\u001b[34m Evidence: Rollout status:\r\n      NAME       READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE   CONTAINERS   IMAGES\r\n      checkout   1/3     3            1           2d    checkout   registry.acme.dev/checkout:4.12.0\r\n      \r\n      Recent events:\r\n      LAST SEEN   TYPE      REASON              OBJECT                  MESSAGE\r\n      2m          Normal    ScalingReplicaSet   deployment/checkout   Scaled up replica set checkout-7d9 to 3\r\n      1m          Warning   BackOff             pod/checkout-7d9-x2k   Back-off restarting failed container\r\n      \r\n      Recent logs:\r\n      ERROR TaxClient: unexpected field \"jurisdiction\" in response (4.12.0)\r\n      ERROR POST /checkout 502 upstream tax-service\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:47.750Z\u001b[34m Note: Checkout 5xx above 5%: errors began right after the latest rollout of shop/checkout.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:47.751Z\u001b[34m Hypothesis: The latest release introduced a regression (High) — Errors start with the newest replica set; earlier pods were healthy.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:47.751Z\u001b[34m Hypothesis: Pods are short of memory under load (Medium) — Restarts cluster around traffic peaks.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:47.751Z\u001b[34m Hypothesis: A downstream dependency is slow (Low) — Some timeouts mention an upstream call.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m2026-10-05T07:20:47.752Z\u001b[34m ActionProposed: Agent proposed rollback: Errors began with the latest rollout; roll back to the last healthy revision.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   \u001b[90m44c1706c-5dbf-40d0-9cc0-92247fed7b83\u001b[34m rollback: Proposed\u001b[39m\r\n"]
