[39.504762, "o", "\u001b[32m√ Checkout 5xx above 5% resolved\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi # Postmortem: Checkout 5xx above 5%\r\n\r\n- Severity: Critical\r\n- Workload: shop/checkout (prod)\r\n- Opened: 2026-10-05T07:20:37.927Z\r\n- Recovered: 2026-10-05T07:20:54.982Z (less than a minute after opening)\r\n- Resolved: 2026-10-05T07:21:11.368Z\r\n\r\n## Timeline\r\n\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:37.928Z — Opened: An alert opened a Critical incident: Checkout 5xx above 5%\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:40.542Z — Note: Alert again: Checkout 5xx above 5%\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:47.447Z — Evidence: Rollout status:\r\n\r\n  ```\r\n  NAME       READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE   CONTAINERS   IMAGES\r\n  checkout   1/3     3            1           2d    checkout   registry.acme.dev/checkout:4.12.0\r\n\r\n  Recent events:\r\n  LAST SEEN   TYPE      REASON              OBJECT                  MESSAGE\r\n  2m          Normal    ScalingReplicaSet   deployment/checkout   Scaled up replica set checkout-7d9 to 3\r\n  1m          Warning   BackOff             pod/checkout-7d9-x2k   Back-off restarting failed container\r\n\r\n  Recent logs:\r\n  ERROR TaxClient: unexpected field \"jurisdiction\" in response (4.12.0)\r\n  ERROR POST /checkout 502 upstream tax-service\r\n  ```\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:47.750Z — Note: Checkout 5xx above 5%: errors began right after the latest rollout of shop/checkout.\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:47.751Z — Hypothesis: The latest release introduced a regression (High) — Errors start with the newest replica set; earlier pods were healthy.\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:47.751Z — Hypothesis: Pods are short of memory under load (Medium) — Restarts cluster around traffic peaks.\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:47.751Z — Hypothesis: A downstream dependency is slow (Low) — Some timeouts mention an upstream call.\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:47.752Z — ActionProposed: Agent proposed rollback: Errors began with the latest rollout; roll back to the last healthy revision.\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:54.936Z — ActionApproved: Approved by a person: rollback\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:54.963Z — ActionSucceeded: rollback: deployment.apps/checkout rolled back\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:54.982Z — Recovered: deployment \"checkout\" successfully rolled out\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:59.416Z — ActionProposed: Person proposed restart: Clear stuck connections\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:59.416Z — ActionApproved: Asked for by a person: restart\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:59.443Z — ActionSucceeded: restart: deployment.apps/checkout restarted\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:20:59.463Z — Recovered: deployment \"checkout\" successfully rolled out\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:21:03.664Z — Note: Tax service vendor confirmed a schema change in 4.12\r\n- 2026-10-05T07:21:11.368Z — Resolved: Resolved\r\n\r\n## Actions\r\n\r\n- rollback (Agent): Succeeded, recovered — Errors began with the latest rollout; roll back to the last healthy revision.\r\n- restart (Person): Succeeded, recovered — Clear stuck connections\r\n\r\n## Follow-ups\r\n\r\n- Root cause confirmed:\r\n- What would have caught it earlier:\r\n"]
